# label | keys | help key | on or off

always
  quit | ctrl+c | ^c | on

Command line (types)
  run | enter | ↵ | on
  cancel | esc | esc | on
  cancel when empty | ctrl+h | ^h | on
  complete | tab | tab | on
  previous | shift+tab | shift+tab | on
  older | up ctrl+p | ↑/^p | off
  newer | down ctrl+n | ↓/^n | off
